spnav-onshape-bridge (0.1.6-1) unstable; urgency=high

  * Fix a stack buffer overflow in the main event loop that could corrupt
    memory with 7-8 simultaneously connected clients (e.g. several browser
    tabs). Found via a new multi-client integration test and confirmed
    with AddressSanitizer.
  * Add tests/test_cli.py, tests/test_robustness.py, and a make coverage
    target.

 -- Sebastian Polster <polsterseb@protonmail.com>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:00:00 +0000

