spnav-onshape-bridge (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a manual page (fixes lintian's no-manual-page warning).
  * Add a lintian override, with justification, for postinst's
    false-positive maintainer-script-calls-systemctl warning.
  * Fix install.sh waiting on a certificate filename left over from before
    the 0.1.1 CA+leaf revert.
  * Verified against a real lintian --pedantic run in a clean container:
    no remaining warnings.

 -- Sebastian Polster <polsterseb@protonmail.com>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:00:00 +0000

spnav-onshape-bridge (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add clang-tidy/cppcheck/shellcheck/sanitizer CI and fix everything they
    found: a latent int-overflow trap in MSG_BUF_SIZE's computation, atoi
    instead of strtol for --port, predictable rand()-based WAMP IDs, and an
    unchecked calloc() in controller_create() that would crash on OOM.

 -- Sebastian Polster <polsterseb@protonmail.com>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 16:30:00 +0000

spnav-onshape-bridge (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Restore local CA + leaf certificate model; fixes Firefox needing a
    manual per-site certificate exception (see BROWSER_TEST.md).
  * Fix systemd unit ExecStart to work with the package's /usr/bin install
    path, not just the manual install.sh location.
  * --doctor now also checks the systemd StateDirectory certificate
    location.

